			"date": "2026-08-31T16:21:34.442Z",
			"content": "<p>Building an icon catalog isn't just \"pick some icons.\" It's:</p>\n<p>*Defining categories (actions, objects, navigation)<br>\n*Setting a grid and sizing system<br>\n*Naming and organizing consistently<br>\n*Version-controlling the whole library</p>\n<p>Skip a step and future-you pays for it.</p>",
